{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter006-contract-gap","severity":"P1","label":"ApprovalCardDto carries only tool and redacted canonical arguments, so the PWA cannot derive trustworthy scope or impact descriptors.","iteration":6}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter006-allowlist","severity":"P1","label":"Host descriptors must use an explicit enum-and-cardinality allowlist; arbitrary labels create a redaction side channel.","iteration":6}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter006-state-distinction","severity":"P1","label":"Creates-file and line-delta claims require typed tool semantics plus a revalidated base-state precondition; otherwise they are observations, not effects.","iteration":6}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter006-single-redaction-pass","severity":"P2","label":"Redaction count and reasons should be preserved from the canonical pass instead of reconstructed from placeholders.","iteration":6}
{"type":"invariant","id":"inv-iter006-no-client-inference","label":"The phone never infers scope or impact from canonicalArguments and never receives raw values for synopsis generation.","iteration":6}
{"type":"invariant","id":"inv-iter006-bounded-schema","label":"Only allowlisted categorical and cardinality descriptor fields cross the relay boundary.","iteration":6}
